# MORI preserves generated eBPF build products and historical checkpoints
# as research evidence. They belong in the repository, but they should not
# inflate the authored-language statistics.
#
# Actual source files such as:
#   mori_observer.c
#   mori_observer.bpf.c
#   mori_splice_probe.c
#   mori_splice_probe.bpf.c
#
# remain fully counted.


